{"title": "Dash (bonus action)", "pageid": 21828, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dash_(bonus_action)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about a bonus action Dash granted by Expeditious Retreat and Eagle Heart. For the basic version of this action, see <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a>. For the rogue's bonus action dash, see <a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Dash\" title=\"Cunning Action: Dash\">Cunning Action: Dash</a>. For the monk's bonus action dash, see <a href=\"/wiki/Step_of_the_Wind:_Dash\" title=\"Step of the Wind: Dash\">Step of the Wind: Dash</a>. </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dash_bonus_action.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Dash_bonus_action.webp/300px-Dash_bonus_action.webp, /w/images/9/93/Dash_bonus_action.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Dash_bonus_action.webp/300px-Dash_bonus_action.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/Dash_bonus_action.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Dash</b> is a bonus action version of the common <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/40px-Dash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp/20px-Dash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Dash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a> ability. This ability allow characters to double their movement speed.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nCover more distance this turn: double your <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Dash_BonusAction</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Dash_BonusAction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Dash_BonusAction\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IgnoreSilence_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IgnoreSilence (spell flag)\">IgnoreSilence</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Invisible (spell flag)\">Invisible</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=NoCameraMove_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"NoCameraMove (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">NoCameraMove</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Stealth (spell flag)\">Stealth</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Dash\"> Condition: Dash </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Dash_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dash_(Condition)\" title=\"Dash (Condition)\">Dash</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is doubled.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by spells:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Expeditious_Retreat\" title=\"Expeditious Retreat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp/25px-Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp/38px-Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp/50px-Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Expeditious Retreat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp/25px-Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Expeditious_Retreat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Expeditious_Retreat\" title=\"Expeditious Retreat\">Expeditious Retreat</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rage:_Eagle_Heart\" title=\"Rage: Eagle Heart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rage: Eagle Heart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/16/Rage_Eagle_Heart_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rage:_Eagle_Heart\" title=\"Rage: Eagle Heart\">Rage: Eagle Heart</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Refer to the main <a href=\"/wiki/Dash\" title=\"Dash\">Dash</a> page for details that also apply to this version of Dash.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034827\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.074 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2798/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31087/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9775/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1289184/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n106.57%   66.707     32 Template:Trim\n100.00%   62.595      1 -total\n 98.95%   61.940      1 Template:Feature_page\n 18.37%   11.498      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 16.99%   10.632      1 Template:SmSAI\n 15.48%    9.687      5 Template:Icon_text\n 14.27%    8.935      4 Template:Icon_link\n 12.05%    7.543      2 Template:Hidden_code